Package: emacs-chatgpt-web
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), emacs-nox (>= 28.1) | emacs (>= 28.1), chromium, git
Description: Personal ChatGPT website interface for terminal Emacs
 A new Emacs mode and Python companion controlling a dedicated headless Chromium
 session through local pipes. Supports conversation buffers, website login,
 attachments, explicit script execution and checked patch application.
 No ELPA package or OpenAI API key is used. Website compatibility and fully
 text-based authentication are experimental.
